          "§ Measurement",
          "RVR is measured by instruments called transmissometers or forward-scatter meters, located beside the runway at the touchdown zone, the midpoint, and the stop end. It takes account of the intensity of the runway lights and the background luminance (day or night). It can therefore be greater than the meteorological visibility, especially at night, because the bright runway lights can be seen further than unlit objects.",
